# No WoW Forever route data is verified yet. Every step below is a `pending` step naming the
# placeholder it waits for (ForeverGuide/Config/Placeholders.lua). When verified data arrives, replace
# a pending step by real steps (new ids), or keep its id and change its type and status: a deferral
# recorded for a pending step stops applying once the step is no longer pending.
# Races: the four original Alliance races (PH-RACECLASS-COMBOS). Skyborne: PH-RACE-SKYBORNE.

