@desc verified WoW Forever quest data after launch; until then each step is marked as pending.

pending Starting zone, first quest giver and opening quests for your race [id=a.start.route; ph=PH-ROUTE-ALLIANCE-START]
pending Class trainer and level-up training in the starting area [id=a.start.trainer; ph=PH-ROUTE-ALLIANCE-START]
